        <mxCell id="d12_transfer_type_variation" value="&lt;b&gt;[Flow Variation]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Internal Bank Transfer follows the common validation / authorisation / limit / fraud / reservation stages, then bypasses Payment Network Integration and uses an internal settlement/accounting path. Domestic Interbank continues through the Payment Network." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
